"hoglin","piglin","warden","parched","zoglin","piglin brute","phantom","axolotl","pillager","fox","frog","goat","allay","camel","panda","trader llama","copper golem","ravager","creaking","dolphin","drowned","nautilus","sniffer","textures/entity/via/","tropical_a_0","tropical_a_1","tropical_a_2","tropical_a_3","tropical_b_0","tropical_b_1","tropical_b_2","tropical_b_3","glow_squid","egg_belly","right_chest","left_chest","trader_llama","arms","wandering_trader","piglin_brute","croaking_body","tongue","Offset (",
"Length (","Last index (",") is negative",") is greater than array length (","options.skinCustomisation.title","Performance modpack is off in Treasure Settings, so this isn\'t running.","Celeritas needs the WASM version and WebGL 2.","Particle Culling"," is turned off in the Mods screen, so this isn\'t running.","General","How far away terrain is drawn. Shorter distances draw less terrain, which raises frame rates.","High","How bright the game is. Higher values make dark areas easier to see.","How big menus and the HUD are.",
"Makes the game fill your whole screen.","Matches the frame rate to your screen\'s refresh rate. Removes tearing.","Varies","The highest frame rate the game aims for. A lower limit keeps your device cooler.","Moves your view up and down slightly while walking.","Shows how charged your attack is, next to the crosshair or the hotbar.","Shows your frame rate on the HUD.","Shows your coordinates on the HUD.","Shows the special FNAW player skins.","Quality","Fancy draws see-through leaves and nicer weather. Fast is quicker.",
"Medium","How clouds are drawn, or turn them off.","Low","How many particles are shown.","Smooth lighting: soft shadows in corners and under blocks.","Shows round shadows under mobs and items.","Fades out terrain at the edge of your render distance.","Smooths textures that are far away. Lower can be faster on weak graphics chips.","Uses custom item textures from resource packs (OptiFine format).","Red and cyan 3D, for 3D glasses.","Celeritas Renderer","Chunk Build Time","How long chunks can be built each frame. Lower stops chunk building from causing stutters, higher loads new chunks faster.",
"Smooth","Nearby First","Smooth builds every changed chunk in the background. Nearby First rebuilds chunks right next to you at once, so placed and broken blocks show up sooner, but it can stutter.","Fog Occlusion","Skips chunks that are completely hidden in fog.","Block Face Culling","Skips the sides of chunks that face away from you.","Hide Entities in Hidden Chunks","Skips mobs and players inside chunks you can\'t see.","Terrain Multi-Draw","Sends the visible chunks to the graphics chip in a few big batches instead of one by one. Turn it off only if terrain flickers or goes missing.",
"How many chunks are rebuilt per frame when Celeritas isn\'t running. Lower is smoother, higher loads changes faster.","Fixes chunks that sometimes don\'t show up.","tenthsMs","Culling Time","How long each frame can be spent checking which mobs and chests are hidden behind blocks. Higher hides more of them in crowded places, lower leaves more time for the rest of the frame.","Always Draw Within","Mobs and chests this close are always drawn, without checking whether they\'re hidden.","Fast Chests","Draws chests and ender chests as part of the world, which is much faster. Lids still open normally.",
"Fast Beds","Draws beds as part of the world, which is much faster.","Leaf Culling","HUD Batching","Draws the HUD\'s text and icons together instead of one at a time.","HUD Cache","Redraws the HUD only when something on it changes, and reuses the last picture otherwise.","Entity Model Batching","Draws each mob\'s and player\'s body parts together instead of one by one.","Sign Text Distance","Sign text further away than this isn\'t drawn.","Max Particles","How many particles of each kind are kept at once. Lower helps in explosions and busy lobbies.",
"Collision Distance","Particles further away than this move without checking for blocks in their way.","Screen Edge Margin","Particles just outside the screen are still drawn if they\'re within this distance, so big ones don\'t pop in at the edges.","Packet Time","How long each frame can spend on packets from the server (more when they pile up). Lower is smoother, higher loads chunks faster.","Frame Pacing","When frames start missing the screen refresh, the work that can wait (loading chunks, packets) gets less time per frame until they don\'t, so a weak or slowed-down computer holds a steady frame rate. Strong computers never need it.",
"-2","45","40","When Hot","Auto","Steady FPS","Holds a frame rate your screen can show evenly, so motion stays smooth instead of jumping between 44 and 60 fps. Auto picks the highest rate your computer keeps up with. When Hot does that only once heat has slowed your computer down, and stays at full speed while it\'s cool. Works with VSync on. It also makes a fanless laptop heat up slower.","Lighter When Hot","Once heat has slowed your computer down, work that can wait does less: fewer particles at once, mobs and items far away (48+ blocks) update every other tick, and chunks load a little slower. Your frame rate is never capped and nothing near you changes.",
" FPS","Calm FPS","The frame rate on menus (pause menu, title screen, server list), so your device cools down there. Playing, chat and inventories stay at full speed. 60 turns it off.","Background FPS","The frame rate while another window is focused. Lower keeps your device cooler."," sec","Idle After","How long without touching the keyboard or mouse before the frame rate drops.","Idle FPS","The frame rate while idle. Lower keeps your device cooler.","Stop Singleplayer After","How long the singleplayer worker can sit idle while you\'re on a server before it\'s stopped to free memory.",
"Crash Recoveries","How many crashes in a row (within 15 seconds) are recovered from before the game gives up.","Animations","All Animations","Every animated texture. Off freezes them all.","Water Animation","Moving water.","Lava Animation","Moving lava.","Fire Animation","Flickering fire.","Portal Animation","Swirling nether portals.","Block Animations","Magma, sea lanterns, prismarine and other animated blocks.","Rain Splashes","Splash particles where rain lands.","Block Break Particles","Pieces flying out when a block breaks.",
"Block Mining Particles","Small pieces while you mine a block.","Sky and Weather","Sky","The sky color and sunset.","Stars","Stars at night.","Sun and Moon","The sun and moon.","Rain and Snow","Falling rain and snow.","Entities and Effects","Item Frames","Item frames and what\'s in them.","Armor Stands","Armor stands.","Paintings","Paintings.","Beacon Beams","The light beam above beacons.","Enchanting Table Book","The floating book on enchanting tables.","Piston Movement","Blocks sliding when pistons move them.",
